{
    "title": "Homestyler-Room Realize design",
    "description": "Homestyler interior design application can help you easily accomplish the space layout, interior home design, decoration, furniture layout and house redecor of your house or apartment. Using our online 3D floor planner program, you just need to select your favorite furniture, move, rotate and place them to realize your space design.  Just with your fingers, you can easily make beautiful interior decoration. You will find that interior design decoration is as simple and fun as playing a home game, and it's easy to design your dream house!\r\n\r\nPowerful interior decoration & 3D room planner tool!\r\n- Spatial layout, home design, room renovation and decoration, redecoration - all included in one application;\r\n- 3D cloud indoor rendering, real visual panorama rendering renderings;\r\n- Huge library of 3D models including furniture, fireplaces, walls, floors, decorations, plants and more;\r\n- Find the furniture you've browsed in real furniture stores (IKEA, Target, Crate, etc.) and use them in your designs;\r\n- Upload your own photos of empty rooms to create unique room templates;\r\n- Use AR (Augmented Reality) design mode to scan the space around you and try to remodel and re-decorate it in our app;\r\n\r\nInterior design decoration, apartment remodel, furniture layout tool preferred by millions of interior designers & design lovers all over the world!\r\n\r\nHere you can choose the room you like - whether it is a living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, study or a villa, a small house, an apartment or even a backyard garden. Your home decorating dreams can be realized in the easiest and most convenient way. You don't need to master complex 3D modeling; you don't need to draw house floor plans; you just need to choose the furniture you like, move, rotate, and place them, then you can realize your space design. Create beautiful interiors with just your fingers, as easy and fun as playing a simulation game!\r\n\r\nIf you are using the Homestyler home design & decor app for the first time, you can learn it easily by joining our weekly home design challenges.\r\nEvery week we will release home improvement games with different themes like rooms in differents styles or rooms suitable for a specific situation. The winner of each game is guaranteed to be fair and impartial, and will be based on voting results and number of likes and comments. The winning entries will be displayed at the top of the community with winning badges, giving you a full sense of achievement.\r\nYou can also visit our official website on your personal computer - www.homestyler.com, where you can use the online professional floor planner software on our website to make complex and detailed interior design projects and make lifelike realistic renders!\r\n\r\nWe proudly recommend the Styler membership to you. When you subscribe to this membership, you can use more than 3000 carefully selected premium furniture models. And we update new furniture packages on a weekly basis. Throughout the membership experience, you can keep up with furniture trends and always be able to design interior decorations that meet the most up-tp-date styles and trends.\r\n\r\nHomestyler room design app is not only a house design tool, but also an informative interior design database.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Homestyler interior design application can help you easily accomplish the space layout, interior home design, decoration, furniture layout and house redecor of your house or apartment. Using our online 3D floor planner program, you just need to select your favorite furniture, move, rotate and place them to realize your space design.  Just with your fingers, you can easily make beautiful interior decoration. You will find that interior design decoration is as simple and fun as playing a home game, and it&#39;s easy to design your dream house!<br><br>Powerful interior decoration &amp; 3D room planner tool!<br>- Spatial layout, home design, room renovation and decoration, redecoration - all included in one application;<br>- 3D cloud indoor rendering, real visual panorama rendering renderings;<br>- Huge library of 3D models including furniture, fireplaces, walls, floors, decorations, plants and more;<br>- Find the furniture you&#39;ve browsed in real furniture stores (IKEA, Target, Crate, etc.) and use them in your designs;<br>- Upload your own photos of empty rooms to create unique room templates;<br>- Use AR (Augmented Reality) design mode to scan the space around you and try to remodel and re-decorate it in our app;<br><br>Interior design decoration, apartment remodel, furniture layout tool preferred by millions of interior designers &amp; design lovers all over the world!<br><br>Here you can choose the room you like - whether it is a living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, study or a villa, a small house, an apartment or even a backyard garden. Your home decorating dreams can be realized in the easiest and most convenient way. You don&#39;t need to master complex 3D modeling; you don&#39;t need to draw house floor plans; you just need to choose the furniture you like, move, rotate, and place them, then you can realize your space design. Create beautiful interiors with just your fingers, as easy and fun as playing a simulation game!<br><br>If you are using the Homestyler home design &amp; decor app for the first time, you can learn it easily by joining our weekly home design challenges.<br>Every week we will release home improvement games with different themes like rooms in differents styles or rooms suitable for a specific situation. The winner of each game is guaranteed to be fair and impartial, and will be based on voting results and number of likes and comments. The winning entries will be displayed at the top of the community with winning badges, giving you a full sense of achievement.<br>You can also visit our official website on your personal computer - www.homestyler.com, where you can use the online professional floor planner software on our website to make complex and detailed interior design projects and make lifelike realistic renders!<br><br>We proudly recommend the Styler membership to you. When you subscribe to this membership, you can use more than 3000 carefully selected premium furniture models. And we update new furniture packages on a weekly basis. Throughout the membership experience, you can keep up with furniture trends and always be able to design interior decorations that meet the most up-tp-date styles and trends.<br><br>Homestyler room design app is not only a house design tool, but also an informative interior design database.",
